<%--
Stop_Event_Child - deliberately has NO on_stop() override and NO JS class.

Regression target: _stop()'s fast path used to check listener registration for
the dead 'destroy' event name, so .on('stop', ...) listeners on components
without a custom on_stop() silently never fired.
--%>
<Define:Stop_Event_Child>
  <div class="card">
    <p>Child with no on_stop()</p>
  </div>
</Define:Stop_Event_Child>
